On the receive side, the code immediately captures `recvNano := time.Now().UnixNano()` after `conn.Read(buf)`, then computes latency as `recvNano - sendNano` and records it. This confirms that latency is measured from the pre-send timestamp inside the request to the time the response is read, not just server/network time alone.",
